[node name="OilDrips" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "Oil drips (Machinery): a drop falls and spreads into a glossy black puddle, wobbling; three sheen arcs (purple, green, gold) fade in and swirl each its own way; it all fades; 30 kept; the Clip lands the drop. placeholder: life, max_marks and every particle number are the old wardrobe.json / trail script numbers until the designer sets them; the meshes are stand-ins until assets/19's (core/144 judges the look on stills)"
